                                                "sense_id": "aa60671e-818a-37de-8253-5a24ad819adb",
                                                "text": "Be careful when power comes to thee also, lest thou too shouldst smite in thine anger or thy jealousy, for unconquerable strength is a sore weapon in the hands of erring man."
                                            }
